<title>UK: Kleinwort/Winterflood launch share trading service.</title>
<headline>Kleinwort/Winterflood launch share trading service.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker Kleinwort Benson Securities Ltd and Winterflood Securities said on Monday they would launch an automatic order execution service called &quot;Best Wins&quot;.</p>
<p>The service will cover over 2,100 securities and is due to start on August 1.</p>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson is a subsidary of German bank Dresdner Bank. Winterflood is the market-making operation of Close Brothers Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
